    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>Welcome to your night shift.</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time to return that favor. For one night, you must inspect flowers and decide where you'll ship them to. There's a long shift ahead and some of your choices may haunt you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>If you feel you're being watched,  turn off the lights and hide.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Inspect Specimens</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use a variety of tools to inspect  flowers that arrive at the office, including a camera with IR/UV lenses and a microscope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compare the  data you collect with the flower entry at HERBAWiki\u2122 to determine if a flower can be considered anomalous.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choices and Consequences</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll find yourself in the middle of a situation with many conflicts of interest. Depending on what you choose, you will make some people unhappy. Decide your route and survive through the consequences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dealing with the Unknown</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on what foes you make along the way, your reality can certainly be altered.\u00a0<i>The game may not be the same every time.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>Welcome to your night shift.</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time to return that favor. For one night, you must inspect flowers and decide where you'll ship them to. There's a long shift ahead and some of your choices may haunt you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>If you feel you're being watched,  turn off the lights and hide.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Inspect Specimens</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use a variety of tools to inspect  flowers that arrive at the office, including a camera with IR/UV lenses and a microscope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compare the  data you collect with the flower entry at HERBAWiki\u2122 to determine if a flower can be considered anomalous.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choices and Consequences</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll find yourself in the middle of a situation with many conflicts of interest. Depending on what you choose, you will make some people unhappy. Decide your route and survive through the consequences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dealing with the Unknown</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on what foes you make along the way, your reality can certainly be altered.\u00a0<i>The game may not be the same every time.</i></p>",
